    "summary": "The bearer can shoot with this weapon only in [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), provided that this turn it [Remained Stationary](vsdata:core-rule/remain-stationary) and that its **Deathstrike Missile** ability was not used to **Adjust Target** or **Designate Target** in this phase.\n\nIt picks no target when it shoots with this weapon. Instead, resolve the weapon's attacks against every unit up to 6\" from the centre of the bearer's **Deathstrike Target** marker, with a separate roll for each of those units.",
